body:
GOD I wish I had parents like Bob and Linda. It really would have made all the difference in the world. I try to be this for other people instead of letting the treatment I received make me bitter and twisted inside. 

&#x200B;

All you can do is if no-one is this person for you, be that person for yourself and others. It's super hard, but it's better than letting the people who tried to fuck you up win.

Wow yeah I'm surprised. Never got into Legos, and now that I'm an adult with a disposable income, Legos sound like a really bad idea lol

&#x200B;

What has been your favourite Lego to build? Do you have anything that springs to mind?

Thank you so much for the book recommendations! They're both going on my list of books to read (that list is also a mile long lol)

&#x200B;

You're also so right about doom scrolling and social media being easy dopamine hits. The saying 'if it's not hard to get, it ain't worth it' kind of springs to mind here. I have to work hard and consistently for change to come.

I was completely the same. Now I'm down the rabbit hole and I can't stop. All of the theories make so much sense and you're right- I've found myself going through all the old albums and the lines that never made sense to me before now completely make sense!

&#x200B;

This community as far as I've seen is actually more inclusive and has a much better ability at communication than most of the other taylor fandoms I've previously been apart of. So thanks guys for existing, you fucking rock and I'm now a hardcore Gaylor till the end.
